- [ ] **Step 3: Add the explicit resolver and candidate records**

Add the spec-defined immutable records verbatim. Use an explicit `_FAMILY_CONTEXT_MAP`; normalize only whitespace, hyphens, dots, and case. Do not use token-order fallbacks.

```python
FUTURE_CANDIDATE_STATUS = "FUTURE_CANDIDATE_NOT_VALIDATED"

def resolve_family_context(family_key: str) -> FragranceFamily | None:
    token = "_".join(
        family_key.strip().casefold().replace("-", "_").replace(".", "_").split()
    )
    return _FAMILY_CONTEXT_MAP.get(token)
```

